  "text": "You have an inborn ability to detect and understand magical phenomena. You can cast the Detect Magic cantrip as an arcane innate spell at will. A cantrip is heightened to a spell rank equal to half your level rounded up.\n\nIn addition, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to checks to Identify Magic and to Decipher Writing of a magical nature. These skill actions typically use the Arcana, Nature, Occultism, or Religion skill.",
